<rectangle x="60" y="52" width="75" height="40" fill="#FFC83D" corner-radius="full"/>
<text x="60" y="58" width="75" height="28" font-size="20" font-weight="700" color="#0B1B3A" text-align="center" line-height="1.4">AI</text>
<text x="60" y="112" width="1080" height="135" font-size="54" font-weight="800" color="#FFFFFF" text-align="left" line-height="1.25">oh-my-claudecode: cả đội agent chạy ngay trong Claude Code</text>
<text x="60" y="269" width="1080" height="68" font-size="24" font-weight="400" color="#BFD0F0" text-align="left" line-height="1.4">Một lệnh /team để Claude Code chia việc, kiểm tra và sửa lỗi theo vòng, thay vì một agent làm hết.</text>
<text x="60" y="451" width="1080" height="48" font-size="34" font-weight="800" color="#0B1B3A" text-align="left" line-height="1.4">Các mảnh ghép</text>
<rectangle x="60" y="545" width="280" height="193" fill="#CFF5EE" stroke="#0B1B3A" stroke-width="3" corner-radius="24"/>
<text x="80" y="567" width="240" height="55" font-size="22" font-weight="800" color="#1F2A44" text-align="left" line-height="1.25">Plugin trong Claude Code</text>
<text x="80" y="632" width="240" height="84" font-size="15" font-weight="400" color="#1F2A44" text-align="left" line-height="1.4">Đưa các skill /team, /autopilot, /ralph vào phiên Claude Code qua marketplace của plugin.</text>
<rectangle x="460" y="545" width="280" height="193" fill="#FFD9CF" stroke="#0B1B3A" stroke-width="3" corner-radius="24"/>
<text x="480" y="567" width="240" height="28" font-size="22" font-weight="800" color="#1F2A44" text-align="left" line-height="1.25">Lệnh omc (gói npm)</text>
<text x="480" y="605" width="240" height="84" font-size="15" font-weight="400" color="#1F2A44" text-align="left" line-height="1.4">Lệnh terminal: omc setup, omc team, omc ask. Cài bằng gói npm oh-my-claude-sisyphus.</text>
<rectangle x="860" y="545" width="280" height="193" fill="#FFF0B8" stroke="#0B1B3A" stroke-width="3" corner-radius="24"/>
<text x="880" y="567" width="240" height="28" font-size="22" font-weight="800" color="#1F2A44" text-align="left" line-height="1.25">Đội native (/team)</text>
<text x="880" y="605" width="240" height="105" font-size="15" font-weight="400" color="#1F2A44" text-align="left" line-height="1.4">Các agent Claude phối hợp trên một danh sách việc chung; cần bật cờ đội native trong settings.json (bước 4).</text>
<rectangle x="60" y="812" width="280" height="187" fill="#DDE8FF" stroke="#0B1B3A" stroke-width="3" corner-radius="24"/>
<text x="80" y="834" width="240" height="28" font-size="22" font-weight="800" color="#1F2A44" text-align="left" line-height="1.25">Worker tmux</text>
<text x="80" y="872" width="240" height="105" font-size="15" font-weight="400" color="#1F2A44" text-align="left" line-height="1.4">Pane tmux chạy CLI thật (claude, codex, gemini, antigravity, grok, cursor-agent); sinh khi cần, tắt khi xong.</text>
<rectangle x="460" y="812" width="280" height="187" fill="#CFF5EE" stroke="#0B1B3A" stroke-width="3" corner-radius="24"/>
<text x="480" y="834" width="240" height="28" font-size="22" font-weight="800" color="#1F2A44" text-align="left" line-height="1.25">Thư mục .omc/</text>
<text x="480" y="872" width="240" height="63" font-size="15" font-weight="400" color="#1F2A44" text-align="left" line-height="1.4">Nơi OMC giữ trạng thái chạy, dữ liệu phiên, kế hoạch và log của dự án.</text>
<line x1="200" y1="545" x2="200" y2="519" stroke="#FF6B4A" stroke-width="5"/>
<line x1="200" y1="519" x2="1000" y2="519" stroke="#FF6B4A" stroke-width="5"/>
<line x1="1000" y1="519" x2="1000" y2="545" stroke="#FF6B4A" stroke-width="5" arrow-end="triangle" pointer-length="14" pointer-width="14"/>
<line x1="600" y1="738" x2="600" y2="775" stroke="#FF6B4A" stroke-width="5"/>
